          "children": [
            {
              "id": "7dc3d432-937d-4ff6-bc53-0176f5c95c00",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "💖 Welcome!",
              "anchorId": "welcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "78f54a98-a5b6-4bd9-81d7-0c3f4ed1b740",
              "type": "callout",
              "html": "This is a Notion template for a job application manager that makes the process of loo<a href=\"/3d5d37415ce0432bb104bc5d8c69491e?pvs=25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">king for work a little less shitty by providing some foundational structure of where information coach</a>is deposited, and makes it easier to share new jobs you’re applying to with your Mentors and other people who can provide feedback on your applications.<br><br>Created by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/javierabegazo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Javiera Cordero</a>, if you have any other improvements or suggestions feel invited to let her know! 🌻 <br><br>To make this template your own, <strong>Click on the “DUPLICATE” button at the top right corner of the page. </strong>",
              "icon": "💡",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "f9ddf32e-4050-4b13-a7e0-48430ed862ee",
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "./assets/images/screen-shot-2022-10-14-at-12-01-18-pm-6fe4984a52bc.webp",
                  "caption": "",
                  "alt": "Screen Shot 2022-10-14 at 12.01.18 PM.png"
                },
                {
                  "id": "502111e9-8166-4fdd-9345-e2eb00308166",
                  "type": "subsubheader",
                  "html": "The actual Magic ✨✨✨ of this Template",
                  "anchorId": "the-actual-magic-of-this-template"
                },
                {
                  "id": "558384de-c6e6-434e-9c86-e2f13b99ef1b",
                  "type": "bulleted_list",
                  "html": "Notion has the ability to structure data within easy to use Databases"
                },
                {
                  "id": "380a6de7-1fe6-4c45-8f79-acf51d5fc93e",
                  "type": "bulleted_list",
                  "html": "These databases can be envisioned as a 3D way to represent data if Spreadsheets like Google Sheets are a 2D way."
                },
                {
                  "id": "1999da73-a6f5-46ee-933f-f62c3259c90d",
                  "type": "bulleted_list",
                  "html": "Databases can also be configured to have Properties that are Relational Properties, so that the Jobs and Companies and People Databases can show relations between items."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
