    },
    {
      "id": "6c45e686-f9a8-4321-ac92-25df655b2477",
      "type": "callout",
      "html": "A database of all the people in the industry you know that could help you prepare for readiness in the job you’re looking for, such as <strong>recruiters</strong>, <strong>mentors</strong> or <strong>friends</strong> who work at companies you’re applying for.",
